Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.46,0:00:57.55,OP Trad,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Mesmo se perdermos tudo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:01:01.89,OP Trad,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}continue unindo as esperanças de todos.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.39,0:01:05.89,OP Trad,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Por que estou aqui?
